      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I may get booed and hissed for this, but perhaps its time to revisit the \"optional\" nature of the RI? If it remains optional, I agree with Steve that indexing RDF is not a core service. If not... well, then a goodly number of things change.</p>",
     "created": "15/Nov/11 5:44 PM",
